# Play test of Aurelis (CIPlay aurelis, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The camp on the west rim (-57 22, 6.5 m), the watch temple on the south rim's top (0 -78, 19 m); the blue hole in the
# lagoon (round 0 15): the agora (-12 26, 18 m down), the harbour shrine (-26 12, 14 m), the canal bridge (16 14, its
# floor 22 m), the sluice wall (z 37.5) and the inner basin's shrine (0 45, 18 m); the tower (0 15), the crystal gate at
# 0 8.5 and the throne hall behind it (x -3..3, z -4..8, 22 m down); the risen platform 7.3 m up on the tower.
island Aurelis
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Aurelis Rising
wait 5
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Turtle 2

# Chapter 1 - the rim: the camp, the journal, the locker (a step) and box; the watch temple, its tablet, the altar refuses; the ruins box (a step)
at -53.5 22 h=7.5
walk -54 22 to -57 22 h=6.5
zone camp
expect step 1
read Archaeologist's journal
expect step 2
open Expedition dive locker
expect step 3
open Camp box
at 0 -73 h=20
zone watchtemple
expect step 4
read Tablet of the sea-priests
expect step 5
use altar
expect message a hollow in its top
open Rim ruins box
expect step 6

# Chapter 2 - the drowned streets: the agora, its basket and urn, the three crystals, the lost barrel (the inner basin's shrine sealed till the sluice opens)
at -12 26 h=-15
zone agora
expect step 7
open Agora market basket
expect step 8
open Agora urn
expect step 9
at -24 12 h=-12
open Harbour temple shrine
expect story crystal 1
expect step 10
at 16 11 h=-19
open Box under the canal bridge
expect story crystal 2
expect step 11
open Expedition's lost barrel
expect step 12
at 0 34 h=-11
zone sluice
expect step 13
use sluicewheel
wait 5
at 0 43 h=-15
open Inner basin shrine
expect story crystal 3
expect step 14

# Chapter 3 - the gate, its guardian, the throne hall and the crown
at 0 11 h=-18
zone gate
expect step 15
kill Angler fish
expect step 16
use crystalgate
expect shown socketlights
wait 5
at 0 5 h=-20
zone thronehall
expect step 17
air thronehallair
open Crown on the drowned throne
expect story crown 1
expect step 18
expect shown altarzone

# Chapter 4 - rising: the crown on the altar, the tower rises, the treasury
at 0 -75 h=20.5
zone altar
expect step 19
use altar
expect story priestkey 1
expect step 20
expect shown risen
at 0 15.5 h=7.8
open Treasury of Aurelis
expect done
